h","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.5a056e","j":"mcq","s":"Which is an <b>opaque</b> material?","p":["wood","clear plastic","greaseproof paper","thin cloth"],"a":"wood","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.c03ba9","j":"mcq","s":"Shadows become ______ when the object is close to the light source.","p":["big","coloured","lost","small"],"a":"big","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.a9dfa7","j":"mcq","s":"The moon looks bright because it reflects ______ light.","p":["the sun","fireflies","star","lamp"],"a":"the sun","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.8c3008","j":"isi","s":"Shadows become ______ when the object is far from the light source.","bank":["long","big","bright","small"],"a":"small","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.0630dd","j":"bs","s":"A <i>flashlight</i> is a light source.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.0cb679","j":"bs","s":"<i>moon</i> is the source of light.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.ea0166","j":"bs","s":"<i>oil paper</i> is an opaque material.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.da8759","j":"jadual","s":"Classify objects.","kepala":["Object","Group"],"bank":["light source","not a light source"],"baris":[{"sel":["the sun"],"a":"light source"},{"sel":["stone"],"a":"not a light source"},{"sel":["book"],"a":"not a light source"},{"sel":["star"],"a":"light source"}],"aras":3},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-6.9af4b7","j":"jadual","s":"Classify materials according to the light that can pass through them.","kepala":["Material","Type"],"bank":["translucent","translucent","opaque"],"baris":[{"sel":["clear glass"],"a":"translucent"},{"sel":["book"],"a":"opaque"},{"sel":["stone"],"a":"opaque"},{"sel":["blurred glass"],"a":"translucent"}],"aras":3}]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7","nama":"Electricity","soalan":[{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.99356b","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>source of electricity</b>?","p":["fan","bulb","television","dry cells"],"a":"dry cells","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.b24c1e","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>source of electricity</b>?","p":["fan","wire","television","generator"],"a":"generator","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.d23084","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>source of electricity</b>?","p":["wire","main electricity supply","bulb","television"],"a":"main electricity supply","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.6325e1","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>source of electricity</b>?","p":["switch","watch battery","bulb","wire"],"a":"watch battery","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.94b401","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>not a source of electricity</b>?","p":["fan","watch battery","solar cells","generator"],"a":"fan","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.89bbf4","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>not a source of electricity</b>?","p":["main electricity supply","dry cells","television","watch battery"],"a":"television","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.3938c7","j":"mcq","s":"A component that <i>lights up when there is an electric current</i> is ______.","p":["bulb","dry cells","wire","switch"],"a":"bulb","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.233225","j":"mcq","s":"The function of a <b>switch</b> is ______.","p":["turn the circuit on and off","holding a light bulb","connect components","lights up when there is an electric current"],"a":"turn the circuit on and off","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.6a3728","j":"mcq","s":"The bulb does not light because of the ______ circuit.","p":["incomplete","new","complete","bright"],"a":"incomplete","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.c4e171","j":"isi","s":"The function of <b>wires</b> is ______.","bank":["lights up when there is an electric current","connect components","supply electricity","holding a light bulb"],"a":"connect components","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.daf2ff","j":"isi","s":"The component that <i>holds the bulb</i> is ______.","bank":["bulb holder","bulb","switch","wire"],"a":"bulb holder","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.cd803f","j":"isi","s":"Wall clocks use ______ as an electrical source.","bank":["generator","main cable","dry cells","large solar cells"],"a":"dry cells","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.d717f1","j":"bs","s":"A <i>solar cell</i> is not a source of electricity.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.6fc605","j":"bs","s":"We can touch the switch with wet hands.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.c94041","j":"bs","s":"The bulb lights up when the circuit is complete.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.cde198","j":"bs","s":"We can fly kites near electric cables.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.e8beb1","j":"bs","s":"Turn off the switch after using electrical equipment.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.eb58b4","j":"bs","s":"The bulb stays on if the wire is broken.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.78ffb2","j":"bs","s":"Solar cells convert sunlight into electricity.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-7.c920b6","j":"padankan","s":"Match the circuit components with their functions.","pasangan":[["dry cells","supply electricity"],["bulb","lights up when there is an electric current"],["switch","turn the circuit on and off"],["wire","connect components"],["bulb holder","holding a light bulb"]],"aras":2}]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8","nama":"A mixture","soalan":[{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.e6d699","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>soluble in water</b>?","p":["chalk flour","sand","cooking oil","sugar"],"a":"sugar","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.cde30f","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>soluble in water</b>?","p":["chalk flour","salt","marbles","small stone"],"a":"salt","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.ac88e8","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>soluble in water</b>?","p":["chalk flour","sand","chocolate drink powder","cooking oil"],"a":"chocolate drink powder","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.ba291c","j":"mcq","s":"Which is <b>soluble in water</b>?","p":["sand","marbles","chalk flour","syrup"],"a":"syrup","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.c1d6af","j":"mcq","s":"Which <b>does not dissolve in water</b>?","p":["chocolate drink powder","salt","sugar","sand"],"a":"sand","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.10f5e6","j":"mcq","s":"Which <b>does not dissolve in water</b>?","p":["chocolate drink powder","sugar","marbles","coffee powder"],"a":"marbles","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.b618ea","j":"mcq","s":"Which <b>does not dissolve in water</b>?","p":["salt","coffee powder","syrup","small stone"],"a":"small stone","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.15a830","j":"mcq","s":"Which <b>does not dissolve in water</b>?","p":["chalk flour","coffee powder","chocolate drink powder","syrup"],"a":"chalk flour","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.fb0e67","j":"mcq","s":"A mixture of <b>sand and water</b> is separated by means of ______.","p":["sieving","picking by hand","using magnets","filtering"],"a":"filtering","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.c2d0d6","j":"mcq","s":"A mixture of <b>iron nails and sand</b> is separated by means of ______.","p":["scoop out the oil layer","sieving","using magnets","picking by hand"],"a":"using magnets","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.d1dd83","j":"mcq","s":"A mixture of <b>oil and water</b> is separated by means of ______.","p":["sieving","filtering","picking by hand","scoop out the oil layer"],"a":"scoop out the oil layer","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.402d8a","j":"mcq","s":"Sugar dissolves faster in water ______.","p":["cold","frozen","ice","hot"],"a":"hot","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.4ef1dc","j":"mcq","s":"Oil will ______ on top of water.","p":["sunk","dissolve","floating","lost"],"a":"floating","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.48b328","j":"isi","s":"A mixture of <b>rice and flour</b> is separated by ______.","bank":["using magnets","scoop out the oil layer","sieving","filtering"],"a":"sieving","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.cb3879","j":"isi","s":"Sugar dissolves faster if ______.","bank":["stirred","frozen","closed","left"],"a":"stirred","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.d380e0","j":"bs","s":"<i>coffee powder</i> dissolves in water.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.87eea2","j":"bs","s":"<i>cooking oil</i> does not dissolve in water.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.9b1145","j":"bs","s":"A mixture of green beans and marbles is separated by using a magnet.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.7c042f","j":"padankan","s":"Match the mixture by separating it.","pasangan":[["sand and water","filtering"],["rice and flour","sieving"],["iron nails and sand","using magnets"],["green beans and marbles","picking by hand"],["oil and water","scoop out the oil layer"]],"aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-8.9a40ec","j":"jadual","s":"Classify the materials.","kepala":["Material","Soluble / insoluble"],"bank":["soluble in water","insoluble in water"],"baris":[{"sel":["chocolate drink powder"],"a":"soluble in water"},{"sel":["coffee powder"],"a":"soluble in water"},{"sel":["sand"],"a":"insoluble in water"},{"sel":["syrup"],"a":"soluble in water"}],"aras":3}]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9","nama":"Earth","soalan":[{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.4586cb","j":"mcq","s":"In the water cycle, after <i>sea water is heated by the sun</i>, ______","p":["water evaporates into steam","it's raining","water flows into rivers and seas","water vapor forms clouds"],"a":"water evaporates into steam","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.357c7f","j":"mcq","s":"In the water cycle, after <i>water evaporates into steam</i>, ______","p":["water flows into rivers and seas","it's raining","sea water is heated by the sun","water vapor forms clouds"],"a":"water vapor forms clouds","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.540901","j":"mcq","s":"In the water cycle, after <i>water vapor forms clouds</i>, ______","p":["it's raining","water flows into rivers and seas","sea water is heated by the sun","water evaporates into steam"],"a":"it's raining","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.e59a30","j":"m