b33cd","j":"mcq","s":"Which practices <b>waste water</b>?","p":["repair a leaking pipe","wash the car with the tap all the time","take a bath using a dipper","turn off the tap when brushing your teeth"],"a":"wash the car with the tap all the time","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.529895","j":"isi","s":"Water ______ is water that flows from high areas to the sea.","bank":["well","pool","the sea","river"],"a":"river","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.9b5d5b","j":"isi","s":"Water ______ is found underground and taken through wells.","bank":["underground","river","rain","the sea"],"a":"underground","aras":2},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.130d1e","j":"bs","s":"Most water is found in the sea.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.50285a","j":"bs","s":"Throwing garbage into the river keeps the water clean.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.c29348","j":"bs","s":"Rain comes from clouds.","a":"True","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.782ba8","j":"jadual","s":"Classify practices.","kepala":["Practice","Effect"],"bank":["save water","waste water"],"baris":[{"sel":["wash the car with the tap all the time"],"a":"waste water"},{"sel":["turn off the tap when brushing your teeth"],"a":"save water"},{"sel":["leave the tap open"],"a":"waste water"},{"sel":["watering trees when it rains"],"a":"waste water"}],"aras":3},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-9.d2b51f","j":"susun","s":"Arrange the stages of the water cycle.","susunan":["sea water is heated by the sun","water evaporates into steam","water vapor forms clouds","it's raining"],"aras":3}]},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-10","nama":"Technology","soalan":[{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-10.5f987f","j":"mcq","s":"The modern tool that replaced the <b>broom</b> is the ______.","p":["boat engine","electric light","vacuum cleaner","electric fan"],"a":"vacuum cleaner","aras":1},{"id":"t2-sains-dlp-10.21c744","j":"mcq","s":"The <b>electric fan</b> is a modern technology for ______.","p":["abacus","bi